{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_005_03_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7d9aabc45b06754084efdfce09f2e175714e72a7fb74922a162bbc24aee0b64f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_d:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e050cbe39053b8e06d7d2a904df020e2e77d8cc142c3c8627e36aea371bb8b73",
      "text": "悠介，情况怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:423c002fa4b57943adc702cbcf557e0b2cfbc9dfba8eaa445d3a98b8507196aa",
      "text": "比之前好很多了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe9d35ab260e52b2f634a5a8a7da290463e1ca0d8466db49a5da6b813de62ffe",
      "text": "已经定在下周末出院了……\n不过医生还是嘱咐要继续做康复训练。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05207774fd3cb96e302805159073ecac7731d9c8c2e8f3b043c48e8fcc4dc935",
      "text": "要想恢复到以前那样的踢法，\n可能还需要一点时间。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95f79384359629439dabb2d8788e63f9f9f83b2a061589d6388aac500920bd97",
      "text": "这样啊……关于享介的事，你大概也注意到了吧。\n因为你的伤，他陷入了低迷。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfde17b6fbd64211d065e1c59362d2a8667d209f2778c75713af5cc400baeda2",
      "text": "啊，哈哈……是的。\n前几天的比赛我看了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d877261e79fc2b8222ce07d6598b7db645a57f9f47163b6ba5675cd7b17b0328",
      "text": "……如果有“哪怕一个人也要踢下去”的决心，\n应该能稍微跑动起来的。看来还是相当困难啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_d:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b90e3518b2826bbdd9eb20d07cb7f9c4ec681909fe31cc5844131e508ba80293",
      "text": "既然你要出院了，配合你的步调，\n我也打算让享介先离开比赛名单好好休息一阵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89818ae7d26b550472e9de979c6fb9dc31c270a34d29d76800eed96f0581a6ed",
      "text": "在这段时间里，你们两个人好好聊聊以后的事吧。\n享介那边由我去说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_d:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d25c8e1cd716014522d53a634541c3fe7c8644c93b302bcaff7d15bcdb85a2a8",
      "text": "明白了。\n麻烦您了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
